# English-only code comments

Comments in source are **English**. User-facing copy stays Russian.

- English for `//`, `/* */`, JSX comments, CSS comments, and JSDoc
- A comment says **why**, not the obvious what
- When editing a file, translate a non-English comment instead of leaving it

```typescript
// ❌ BAD
// Отправляем заявку на почту
mail($to, $subject, $body);

// ✅ GOOD
// mail() is already running on shared hosting; no Node process for one form
mail($to, $subject, $body);
```
